// Windows application icon for OpenBumpy. Explorer/taskbar use the icon group
// with the lowest resource id, so this claims id 1. bumpy.ico is a multi-size
// (16..256) letterboxed render of the game's own BUMPRESE.VEC startup splash
// (Bumpy's face peeking over the ledge), built by
// tools/re/build_splash_icon.py -- see that script's header.
1 ICON "bumpy.ico"
